  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The displacement time graph of a particle executing SHM is given in figure: (sketch is schematic and not to scale)&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0102_f760007a2182.png\" style=\"width: 423px; height: 232px;\" /></p><p>Which of the following statements is/are true for this motion?&nbsp;</p><p>(A) The force is zero at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br />(B) The magnitude of acceleration is maximum at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi></math><br />(C) The speed is maximum at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br />(D) The <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>.</mo></math> is equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>.</mo></math> of the&nbsp;oscillation at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mfenced></math>",
